WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
This is the Life Sciences Production Continuity war room. A batch deviation starts here. What follows is a simulated incident.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Particulate counts in fill-finish Suite B ran above the alert limit for forty minutes during a batch. The operator loads the deviation report.

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Six engines assess it. The batch is on hold, and two downstream batches slip by about a week. Exposure runs from one point five to three point two million dollars. The risk score is seventy-three out of one hundred.

4
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:55.000
The Operations Strategist receives the case in one click, and projects the exposure with action, and without it.

5
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:10.000
The Executive Portal shows the decision: hold the batch and open a formal deviation investigation within four hours, for twenty-five thousand dollars. The system recommends. The head of quality decides.

